WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.699
A Professional AI Operating Model brings six responsibilities together: purpose, limited AI roles, human ownership, an evidence-based review process, responsible boundaries and a commitment to improve.

00:00:12.699 --> 00:00:15.630
This is not a technical architecture.

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:25.887
It is a practical guide to who does what, how work is checked and when the next action requires a person.
